    <string name="vpn_state_inactive">VPN inactive</string>
    <string name="card_vpn_hint">The “VPN” action toggles the selected client in the background — no app UI is ever shown. Happ uses the official happ://toggle_without_ui deeplink (no-UI interceptor) and the widget command; incy uses the llc.itdev.incy.TOGGLE broadcast to its system receiver. No root required. “Auto” picks the first installed client. If toggling does not work, open Happ → Settings and enable deeplink control, then check the log at the bottom of this screen.</string>

